# Input graph for laBioSynCare__laBioSynCare.github.io__scripts_sstim-ecosystem-contract.py__build_validation_graph — written during translation, reinforced at repair.
# Covers: several relationshipTarget solutions (targetA, targetC and targetE
# match the catalog profile type, targetB does not, targetZ is not in the
# catalog at all: both must be skipped), a catalog node (targetD) that the
# artifact reaches only through another predicate, and neighbouring triples
# that must NOT match (rel4 uses a different predicate; the catalog holds
# predicates outside the closed profile for the retained targets, which the
# result must not contain).  targetA is reached twice (two relationships).
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix eco: <https://w3id.org/sstim/ecosystem#> .

ex:rel1 eco:relationshipTarget ex:targetA .
ex:rel2 eco:relationshipTarget ex:targetB .
ex:rel3 eco:relationshipTarget ex:targetC .
ex:rel4 eco:someOtherProperty ex:targetA .
ex:rel5 eco:someOtherProperty ex:targetD .
ex:rel6 eco:relationshipTarget ex:targetE .
ex:rel7 eco:relationshipTarget ex:targetZ .
ex:rel8 eco:relationshipTarget ex:targetA .
# the artifact's own triple about a catalog target: kept as is, not completed
ex:targetA ex:artifactNote "from the artifact" .
